      "content": "hey my daughter was just told she has anemia at her checkup. i have some iron supplements at home but im not sure about the dose. she’s about 110lbs. would it be okay to just give her a double dose like 325mg of elemental iron every day to help her get her levels up faster? i just want her to feel better soon.",
