      "content": "but she's a teenager, not a pregnant woman... i dont think she needs prenatal vitamins. i just have these 325mg tablets right here. if she takes one now and maybe another one tomorrow to really kickstart the process, is that really going to hurt her? it seems like such a small thing to do to help her energy levels immediately instead of just waiting days for a callback.",
